.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH orbit-search 1  "search " 
.SH NAME
orbit\-search \- Find tasks by words
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBorbit search\fR [\fB\-\-all\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIWORDS\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Find tasks by words
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-all\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print one JSON object per result, with `"v":1`, instead of text
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIWORDS\fR>

.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  orbit search milk
  orbit search dentist tomorrow
  orbit search milk \-\-all
